{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"<requirement name=\"normalize-html-whitespace\" stories=\"block-input\">\nMultiple inner whitespaces are collapsed to a single space (except\n        in pre tags):\n\n        >>> normalize_html(\"<p>a  \\t b</p>\")\n        '<p>a b</p>'\n\n    * Whitespace surrounding block-level tags is removed.\n\n        >>> normalize_html(\"<p>a  b</p>\")\n        '<p>a b</p>'\n\n        >>> normalize_html(\" <p>a  b</p> \")\n        '<p>a b</p>'\n</requirement>\n<requirement name=\"normalize-html-markup\" stories=\"html-renderer\">\n* Self-closing tags are converted to open tags.\n\n        >>> normalize_html(\"<br />\")\n        '<br>'\n\n    * Attributes are sorted and lowercased.\n\n        >>> normalize_html('<a title=\"bar\" HREF=\"foo\">x</a>')\n        '<a href=\"foo\" title=\"bar\">x</a>'\n</requirement>\n<requirement name=\"decode-html-references\" stories=\"inline-escapes\">\n* References are converted to unicode, except that '<', '>', '&', and\n      '\"' are rendered using entities.\n\n        >>> normalize_html(\"&forall;&amp;&gt;&lt;&quot;\")\n        '\\u2200&amp;&gt;&lt;&quot;'\n</requirement>\n<requirement name=\"handle-normalization-errors\" stories=\"cli-boundaries\">\nNormalization error: \n</requirement>\n<unattached story=\"architecture\"/>\n<unattached story=\"block-leaves\"/>\n<unattached story=\"block-references\"/>\n<unattached story=\"block-quotes\"/>\n<unattached story=\"block-lists\"/>\n<unattached story=\"inline-code-breaks\"/>\n<unattached story=\"inline-emphasis\"/>\n<unattached story=\"inline-links\"/>\n<unattached story=\"inline-html-autolinks\"/>\n<unattached story=\"cli-executable\"/>\n<unattached story=\"verification-scoped\"/>\n<unattached story=\"verification-full\"/>"}}
